d to be a pastry chef for (antoines? some really famous new orleans bakery) and is the most customer service oriented person I've ever dealt with. All of his doughnuts are amazing but I LOVE bavarian cream filled. I swear when I get a mix of doughnuts I always end up hogging ALL of the BC lol. They also have HUGE cinnamon rolls and king cakes (never had room to try it). Prices are cheaper than WD per doughnut and if it's close to closing time he'll throw a lot of doughnuts in a bag and sell it for a dollar or two. SERIOUSLY I used to walk a nice mile n a half to get some! I should swing by again, I wonder i..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
